      "heading": "Notes",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Together with the Beknur Harbor, this is one of the first accessible locations where Nightfall characters are allowed a party size of 8.",
        "The world map actually marks this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the Blacktide Den mission.",
