  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Blacktide_Den\" title=\"Blacktide Den\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Blacktide_Den_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Blacktide Den (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Blacktide Den\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Blacktide_Den.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Blacktide Den.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a9/Blacktide_Den.jpg/196px-Blacktide_Den.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/a/a9/Blacktide_Den.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Cliffs_of_Dohjok\" title=\"Cliffs of Dohjok\">Cliffs of Dohjok</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Fahranur,_The_First_City\" title=\"Fahranur, The First City\">Fahranur, The First City</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Lahtenda_Bog\" title=\"Lahtenda Bog\">Lahtenda Bog</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Blacktide_Den_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Blacktide Den world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/42/Blacktide_Den_world_map.jpg/196px-Blacktide_Den_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"166\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/42/Blacktide_Den_world_map.jpg/294px-Blacktide_Den_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/42/Blacktide_Den_world_map.jpg/392px-Blacktide_Den_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"765\" data-file-height=\"647\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Blacktide_Den_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Blacktide Den inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/22/Blacktide_Den_inside.jpg/196px-Blacktide_Den_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/22/Blacktide_Den_inside.jpg/294px-Blacktide_Den_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/22/Blacktide_Den_inside.jpg/392px-Blacktide_Den_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"750\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Blacktide Den</b> is a hub for nefarious activities and shady dealings on Istan. It is sufficiently far from the centers of civilization on the island for it to be relatively ignored by the authorities.\n</p>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>This campsite at the edge of the <a href=\"/wiki/Lahtenda_Bog\" title=\"Lahtenda Bog\">Lahtenda Bog</a> is a haven for all manner of shady characters and black market business. From <a href=\"/wiki/Corsair\" title=\"Corsair\">corsairs</a> attempting to escape justice to tomb-robbers looking to pawn their ill-gotten booty, to the odd <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancer\" title=\"Necromancer\">Necromancer</a> simply interested in the death and decay of the swampy bayou to the south, Blacktide Den provides the perfect meeting place: dark, dangerous and remote.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quests_available\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests available</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Crafters\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Crafters</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Merchants_and_traders\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Merchants and traders</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Other_services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other services</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Blacktide_Den_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Following_the_Trail\" title=\"Following the Trail\">Following the Trail</a> will lead the party to the <a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">mission outpost</a>, which is situated at the southwestern corner of the <a href=\"/wiki/Cliffs_of_Dohjok\" title=\"Cliffs of Dohjok\">Cliffs of Dohjok</a>.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a> characters cannot enter this outpost until after completion of the <a href=\"/wiki/Jokanur_Diggings\" title=\"Jokanur Diggings\">Jokanur Diggings</a> mission. Non-Elonian characters are not restricted.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Blacktide_Den_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cliffs_of_Dohjok\" title=\"Cliffs of Dohjok\">Cliffs of Dohjok</a> (northeast)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fahranur,_The_First_City\" title=\"Fahranur, The First City\">Fahranur, The First City</a> (northwest)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lahtenda_Bog\" title=\"Lahtenda Bog\">Lahtenda Bog</a> (south)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests_available\">Quests available</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Blacktide_Den_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Quests available\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>(these quests are only available to <a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a> characters)</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dahleht\" title=\"Dahleht\">Dahleht</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/What_Do_You_Do_with_a_Drunken_Shauben%3F\" title=\"What Do You Do with a Drunken Shauben?\">What Do You Do with a Drunken Shauben?</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Guard_Kovu\" title=\"Guard Kovu\">Guard Kovu</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Defender%27s_Choice\" title=\"Defender&#39;s Choice\">Defender's Choice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/A_Sticky_Operation\" title=\"A Sticky Operation\">A Sticky Operation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Down_on_the_Bayou\" title=\"Down on the Bayou\">Down on the Bayou</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Necromancer_Musseh\" title=\"Necromancer Musseh\">Necromancer Musseh</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt-ology\" title=\"Crypt-ology\">Crypt-ology</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rohtu\" title=\"Rohtu\">Rohtu</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wandered_Off_Again\" title=\"Wandered Off Again\">Wandered Off Again</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fury_of_a_Grieving_Heart\" title=\"Fury of a Grieving Heart\">Fury of a Grieving Heart</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Blacktide_Den_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Blacktide_Den_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Blacktide_Den_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Crafters\">Crafters</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Blacktide_Den_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Crafters\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h5>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fi